            "provenance": {
              "source": "wiki.warframe.com",
              "url": null,
              "revisionId": null,
              "excerpt": "Akimbo Slip Shot is a Secondary Arcane that increases Ammo Efficiency while sliding or aim gliding with Dual Pistols. Effect Rank Ammo Efficiency 0 +15% 1 +25% 2 +35% 3 +45% 4 +55% 5 +65% Acquisition May appear as a Steel Path Circuit Tier 1, 3, 4, 6, or 7 reward on a weekly rotational basis. May be sold by Acrithis for 10 Pathos Clamp on a daily rotational basis, requiring Drifter Intrinsics Opportunity Rank 9 for the Arcanes to appear in her shop. May drop from side Undercroft portals in The Duviri Experience while on The Steel Path. Notes Cannot be equipped on Exalted Weapons like Dex Pixia. Can be equipped on the ( Prisma) Dual Decurion. Additive with Zazvat-Kar for maximum Ammo Efficiency on the Akstiletto Prime. Patch History Hotfix 40.0.3 (2025-10-21) Akbimo Slipshot[sic] Arcane can now be equipped on the (Prisma) Dual Decurions Archguns. Update 33.5 (2023-06-21) Introduced."
            }
